WEBVTT

00:01:38.230 --> 00:01:42.410
<b>Flower Viewing</b>

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:51.410
I'm Kamisaka Haruhi from the School of Magic.

00:01:51.410 --> 00:01:55.550
I'll be with you until our building is fixed, but I hope to get along with everyone.

00:01:56.950 --> 00:02:03.160
I'm Hiiragi Anri.  This year is the year I give up my seat as number 2 at the School of Magic and go to the top.

00:02:03.560 --> 00:02:05.650
Normal class, Takamizo Hachisuke!

00:02:05.650 --> 00:02:10.010
I am currently looking for a girlfriend.   I look forward to hearing from all you ladies.

00:02:11.320 --> 00:02:13.670
Kohinata Yuuma from the normal class.

00:02:13.670 --> 00:02:14.480
Hello, everyone.

00:02:15.980 --> 00:02:17.960
Kohinata Yuuma-kun, huh?

00:02:17.960 --> 00:02:20.420
I thought they looked alike, but...

00:02:20.420 --> 00:02:22.680
Maybe I was wrong after all.

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:29.880
She was the one with Kohinata-kun...

00:02:29.880 --> 00:02:32.820
I'm Watarase Jun from the normal class.

00:02:32.820 --> 00:02:35.370
As you can see, I'm a totally normal girl.

00:02:36.930 --> 00:02:38.330
Kamisaka-san.

00:02:38.840 --> 00:02:43.590
You probably don't know this since you're from the School of Magic, but that's actually a guy.

00:02:45.340 --> 00:02:47.530
But he's so pretty...

00:02:48.350 --> 00:02:51.790
So he's not Kohinata-kun's girlfriend.

00:02:53.300 --> 00:02:56.530
I shouldn't be so relieved over that!

00:03:06.650 --> 00:03:09.080
SIGN:  Entrance Ceremony

00:03:12.240 --> 00:03:16.730
Why do we have to help set up the entrance ceremony?

00:03:16.730 --> 00:03:19.630
We are upperclassmen, you know...

00:03:19.630 --> 00:03:26.230
That's not it.  Why is our class the only ones doing the grunt work of setting up chairs?

00:03:26.230 --> 00:03:26.990
Oh yeah...

00:03:26.990 --> 00:03:29.480
Anri-chan!  You're not...

00:03:32.670 --> 00:03:35.760
OK, everyone, look over here!

00:03:38.380 --> 00:03:42.320
I'm going to use magic to line up all the chairs right away!

00:03:43.560 --> 00:03:44.830
Really?

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:46.890
Wait, Anri-chan!

00:03:46.890 --> 00:03:49.150
Be quiet and watch, Haruhi.

00:03:49.150 --> 00:03:53.550
I'm going to show the kids in the normal class just how awesome I am!

00:03:53.550 --> 00:03:55.110
Let's go, Paella.

00:03:55.110 --> 00:03:57.140
<i>Right, Anri-sama.</i>

00:03:57.140 --> 00:04:04.000
<i>On Elmesas Luk Alsas Astasia Astoum Ruent!</i>

00:04:17.570 --> 00:04:20.310
Wow!  They're all nicely lined up!

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:26.520
That's what you'd expect from the School of Magic's number 2.

00:04:26.520 --> 00:04:30.240
But, are we making the new students sit up there?

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:31.690
H-Huh?

00:04:31.690 --> 00:04:32.720
Anri-chan!

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:52.170
If you don't hurry, you won't be able to go home tonight.

00:04:52.480 --> 00:04:55.140
The entrance ceremony won't wait for you.

00:04:55.140 --> 00:04:58.060
I remember the rumor I heard about Anri-chan.

00:04:58.500 --> 00:04:59.730
What was it?

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:02.330
The trouble maker of the School of Magic.

00:05:03.250 --> 00:05:06.110
Say that kind of thing sooner.

00:05:06.540 --> 00:05:09.480
Well, we're going home.

00:05:09.850 --> 00:05:12.200
OK, be careful.

00:05:12.200 --> 00:05:14.830
Only the guys have to stay?

00:05:14.830 --> 00:05:18.000
We can't have the girls stay out all night.

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:21.820
I'm really sorry, everybody.

00:05:21.820 --> 00:05:24.950
I'm sure if I do it again it'll work.

00:05:26.960 --> 00:05:29.730
That reaction kind of pisses me off.

00:05:29.730 --> 00:05:32.330
Bye, everyone!  Good luck.

00:05:35.970 --> 00:05:39.750
That bastard Jun snuck in with them and went home!

00:05:39.750 --> 00:05:41.380
He does look like a girl.

00:05:41.380 --> 00:05:43.570
Hey, keep moving.

00:05:43.570 --> 00:05:45.300
You won't have any time to sleep!

00:05:45.300 --> 00:05:47.810
OK...

00:06:09.640 --> 00:06:11.290
Brother!

00:06:11.290 --> 00:06:12.930
It's morning!

00:06:12.930 --> 00:06:14.360
Get up, please!

00:06:14.360 --> 00:06:17.640
Let me sleep.  I was up late last night.

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:21.860
No!  Today's my entrance ceremony!

00:06:27.500 --> 00:06:30.650
Sumomo, what are you wearing?

00:06:30.650 --> 00:06:34.080
What?  My uniform, of course!

00:06:35.520 --> 00:06:38.840
I'm wearing my middle school uniform!

00:06:41.640 --> 00:06:43.330
It's only 5:00 AM?

00:06:51.460 --> 00:06:56.690
We will now begin this year's Mizuhosaka Academy Entrance Ceremony.

00:06:56.690 --> 00:07:00.580
Will our returning students please welcome them with applause.

00:07:06.780 --> 00:07:08.190
They're here, Yuuma!

00:07:11.340 --> 00:07:12.750
They're cute!

00:07:12.750 --> 00:07:15.670
Sumomo-chan looks good in anything.

00:07:16.210 --> 00:07:17.150
Oh yeah?

00:07:29.160 --> 00:07:31.000
The entrance ceremony, huh?

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:33.950
SIGN:  Entrance Ceremony

00:07:37.130 --> 00:07:39.450
It's all over!

00:07:39.450 --> 00:07:41.790
Now we clean up.

00:07:41.790 --> 00:07:43.740
No magic, OK?

00:07:43.740 --> 00:07:45.720
I know.

00:07:50.390 --> 00:07:52.030
What's wrong?

00:07:52.030 --> 00:07:53.270
Haruhi?

00:07:53.270 --> 00:07:56.520
No... It's nothing.

00:07:56.850 --> 00:07:59.010
Mom could tell!

00:07:59.010 --> 00:08:03.320
You were looking at Sumomo-chan during the whole ceremony.

00:08:03.320 --> 00:08:05.060
Really, Brother?

00:08:05.280 --> 00:08:08.530
Hey now.  No way.

00:08:08.530 --> 00:08:10.550
Don't be so embarrassed.

00:08:11.600 --> 00:08:13.830
See you!

00:08:11.620 --> 00:08:15.160
SIGN:  Mizuhosaka Academy

00:08:25.820 --> 00:08:29.190
Kamisaka-san, you busy this Sunday?

00:08:29.190 --> 00:08:30.880
N-No...

00:08:30.880 --> 00:08:34.260
You see, we were thinking of going flower viewing.

00:08:34.260 --> 00:08:35.960
Want to come with us?

00:08:35.960 --> 00:08:39.480
I think it'd be a good chance to get to know your classmates!

00:08:39.480 --> 00:08:41.270
Flower viewing, huh?

00:08:41.270 --> 00:08:43.440
Flower viewing?  Sounds fun!

00:08:44.770 --> 00:08:45.630
Then-!

00:08:45.630 --> 00:08:48.560
Of course I'll be coming!

00:08:48.930 --> 00:08:51.610
I'm the one organizing it, actually.

00:08:51.610 --> 00:08:54.220
If Anri-chan is going, I will, too.

00:08:54.220 --> 00:08:57.690
Thanks, Anri-chan, Haruhi-chan!

00:09:06.180 --> 00:09:11.360
So let's split up so we can shop for the flower viewing tomorrow more efficiently.

00:09:11.840 --> 00:09:14.560
We'll decide who goes with who with rock-paper-scissors.

00:09:15.010 --> 00:09:16.040
OK.

00:09:16.040 --> 00:09:16.760
That's fine.

00:09:16.760 --> 00:09:19.390
All right, then...

00:09:20.240 --> 00:09:22.550
Rock, paper...

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:32.600
Yuuma.

00:09:32.600 --> 00:09:33.900
A word.

00:09:33.900 --> 00:09:34.750
Hey...

00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:39.760
We talked about this on the phone last night!

00:09:39.760 --> 00:09:42.660
I'm going with rock, so you need to...

00:09:43.520 --> 00:09:45.540
Got it.

00:09:45.540 --> 00:09:47.130
You're rock, right.

00:09:49.880 --> 00:09:56.110
So as punishment, Yuuma has to get up early and go reserve our spot tomorrow!

00:09:57.380 --> 00:09:59.130
Punishment for what?

00:09:59.130 --> 00:10:02.590
I'm sure the guys have a lot going on.

00:10:03.220 --> 00:10:06.040
Oh, sorry about earlier.

00:10:07.270 --> 00:10:08.630
White Day.

00:10:09.140 --> 00:10:10.740
I didn't get you anything in return.

00:10:10.740 --> 00:10:16.930
It's fine.  I told you when I gave it to you that that chocolate really wasn't for anybody.

00:10:16.930 --> 00:10:18.100
But...

00:10:18.100 --> 00:10:23.040
It's true.  Buying chocolate is just something I do every year.

00:10:31.460 --> 00:10:38.130
When I was a kid, there was a boy who made me want to become a mage.

00:10:39.170 --> 00:10:43.720
I wanted to meet him again, but I didn't even know his name.

00:10:47.900 --> 00:10:52.400
So one day I asked a famous fortune teller about it.

00:10:55.880 --> 00:10:57.020
Valentine's Day.

00:10:58.080 --> 00:11:00.470
I don't know how many years from now it will be,

00:11:00.870 --> 00:11:04.180
but you'll give that boy Valentine's Day chocolate.

00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:13.760
I believed it, and every year I buy chocolate for nobody in particular.

00:11:15.460 --> 00:11:17.040
I'm strange, aren't I?

00:11:17.310 --> 00:11:18.500
I see.

00:11:19.230 --> 00:11:23.600
The magic he used was wonderful...

00:11:25.810 --> 00:11:30.920
But, you know, just using magic doesn't guarantee you'll be happy.

00:12:00.310 --> 00:12:05.920
But, you know, just using magic doesn't guarantee you'll be happy.

00:12:06.270 --> 00:12:10.650
Kohinata-kun... Maybe he doesn't like magic?

00:12:26.780 --> 00:12:28.130
Come to think of it...

00:12:47.330 --> 00:12:48.210
There he is.

00:12:52.250 --> 00:12:53.680
Kohinata-kun?

00:12:54.880 --> 00:12:56.860
Kamisaka-san?

00:12:56.860 --> 00:12:59.250
We weren't going to meet until...

00:12:59.250 --> 00:13:02.370
For some reason, I came early.

00:13:03.190 --> 00:13:04.700
Can I join you?

00:13:04.700 --> 00:13:05.570
Sure.

00:13:24.630 --> 00:13:26.310
Uhm...

00:13:26.820 --> 00:13:29.170
Kohinata-kun, do you... magic...

00:13:30.880 --> 00:13:35.800
But if he doesn't like magic,
he won't like a mage like me.

00:13:38.200 --> 00:13:40.250
What was it, Kamisaka-san?

00:13:40.250 --> 00:13:43.150
U-Uhm, well...

00:13:43.150 --> 00:13:47.120
The cherry blossoms sure are pretty, aren't they?

00:13:48.730 --> 00:13:51.950
Now there's no point in me coming early like this.

00:13:52.720 --> 00:13:55.500
There's that other thing I want to ask him, too.

00:13:58.680 --> 00:14:03.450
"Are you the one who saved me back then?"

00:14:27.590 --> 00:14:29.480
Brother!

00:14:29.480 --> 00:14:30.910
Sumomo?

00:14:31.990 --> 00:14:34.720
I figured you'd be bored.

00:14:34.720 --> 00:14:36.240
Who's she?

00:14:36.590 --> 00:14:39.450
Kamisaka Haruhi-san, a girl from my class.

00:14:39.450 --> 00:14:42.040
She's from the magic school, though.

00:14:42.040 --> 00:14:43.700
I hear she's a really good student.

00:14:48.870 --> 00:14:51.470
I feel like I've met her somewhere...

00:14:57.320 --> 00:15:01.850
I-I'm sorry!  I didn't sleep much yesterday.

00:15:06.050 --> 00:15:08.460
This is my sister, Sumomo.

00:15:08.460 --> 00:15:11.190
She joined our school this year.

00:15:11.190 --> 00:15:12.320
Sumomo-chan?

00:15:13.900 --> 00:15:15.460
Hime-chan?

00:15:16.080 --> 00:15:17.800
You're Hime-chan, aren't you?

00:15:19.270 --> 00:15:20.790
Is it you, Sumomo-chan?

00:15:20.790 --> 00:15:21.920
Yes!

00:15:22.520 --> 00:15:24.280
It's been so long!

00:15:24.280 --> 00:15:25.350
Really!

00:15:25.350 --> 00:15:26.310
This brings back memories.

00:15:26.580 --> 00:15:29.810
Uhm, do you know my sister?

00:15:29.810 --> 00:15:31.200
We were childhood friends!

00:15:33.470 --> 00:15:37.790
But I didn't know you had an older brother.

00:15:37.790 --> 00:15:43.170
My brother became my brother after I started at elementary school.

00:15:43.870 --> 00:15:45.990
Family circumstances, as they say.

00:15:46.340 --> 00:15:47.940
I see...

00:15:52.200 --> 00:15:54.620
Good work getting the place for us.

00:15:55.250 --> 00:15:57.380
Hey, Hachi-san!

00:15:57.380 --> 00:15:58.220
Hello!

00:15:58.870 --> 00:16:00.940
You're both early.

00:16:00.940 --> 00:16:04.400
Kamisaka-san came early this morning.

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:06.150
I felt bad having him here alone.

00:16:06.340 --> 00:16:08.290
Damn it!

00:16:08.290 --> 00:16:10.580
I should've reserved our spot.

00:16:11.210 --> 00:16:12.650
All that's left is...

00:16:13.090 --> 00:16:15.890
Out of the way!

00:16:24.310 --> 00:16:26.130
Successful landing!

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:28.590
I don't know about that...

00:16:33.370 --> 00:16:35.220
Are you OK, Hachi-san?

00:16:37.610 --> 00:16:40.060
That's not enough to kill him.

00:16:40.060 --> 00:16:43.150
We're all here now!

00:16:43.150 --> 00:16:46.570
But I'm impressed you got such a nice place.

00:16:46.570 --> 00:16:49.430
I saw from above, this whole place is full.

00:16:49.430 --> 00:16:53.160
That's right... there were a lot of people at the entrance.

00:16:53.620 --> 00:16:58.820
This is supposed to be the best spot for flower viewing at this park, isn't it?

00:16:58.820 --> 00:17:00.670
Yeah, but...

00:17:01.450 --> 00:17:04.340
Why is there nobody around here?

00:17:04.340 --> 00:17:10.540
Well, you see... I put a barrier spell around it last night.

00:17:10.540 --> 00:17:12.280
Takamine-senpai!

00:17:12.280 --> 00:17:13.980
You were here?

00:17:14.810 --> 00:17:16.580
Am in the way?

00:17:16.580 --> 00:17:18.820
No!  You're very welcome!

00:17:18.820 --> 00:17:21.370
But we might not have enough food...

00:17:21.370 --> 00:17:23.610
Don't worry about that.

00:17:23.610 --> 00:17:25.040
Tama-chan.

00:17:25.040 --> 00:17:26.010
<i>Roger!</i>

00:17:37.860 --> 00:17:39.430
Wow!

00:17:39.430 --> 00:17:41.770
I've also got drinks.

00:17:42.940 --> 00:17:44.130
<i>Leave it to me!</i>

00:17:52.110 --> 00:17:54.460
And warm rice, too.

00:17:55.950 --> 00:17:58.550
<i>Warm and fluffy!</i>

00:18:02.620 --> 00:18:05.980
I heard you had a cooking pot, as well...

00:18:20.140 --> 00:18:23.510
so I put lots of fresh stuff inside of it.

00:18:29.230 --> 00:18:32.480
Unfortunately, it's a bit too fresh.

00:18:32.480 --> 00:18:35.190
Anything else you need?

00:18:35.190 --> 00:18:37.170
No, that's enough.

00:18:53.110 --> 00:18:54.940
Oh no, rain.

00:18:54.940 --> 00:18:59.960
Come to think of it, the news said there'd be rain some places in the afternoon...

00:18:59.960 --> 00:19:02.290
Jeez, we're unlucky.

00:19:03.030 --> 00:19:07.420
Hey, Koyuki-san, do you have some magic that can change the weather?

00:19:07.420 --> 00:19:12.290
Climate control is extremely difficult magic.

00:19:13.110 --> 00:19:15.880
If you're prepared for the possibility that I might destroy the world...

00:19:15.880 --> 00:19:17.830
<i>We can do it any time!</i>

00:19:18.900 --> 00:19:20.300
Ah, that's fine.

00:19:21.480 --> 00:19:29.230
It's hard to change the weather, but I can put up a field so the rain won't fall on us.

00:19:29.230 --> 00:19:30.540
But even so...

00:19:30.540 --> 00:19:32.210
Don't worry.

00:19:32.210 --> 00:19:35.750
I tried it with a sprinkler!

00:19:36.130 --> 00:19:37.910
Let's go, Paella.

00:19:37.910 --> 00:19:39.380
<i>Yes, Anri-sama.</i>

00:19:40.100 --> 00:19:42.450
A sprinkler and rain are totally different...

00:19:43.980 --> 00:19:47.290
<i>On Elmesas Lux Zeotrasas!</i>

00:19:47.290 --> 00:19:51.060
<i>Li Lacile Amlest!</i>

00:19:52.400 --> 00:19:53.690
Wow!

00:20:04.980 --> 00:20:07.360
Big success!

00:20:09.600 --> 00:20:12.460
Didn't it work at all?

00:20:15.740 --> 00:20:17.060
No way...

00:20:17.060 --> 00:20:20.000
The magic circle was perfect!

00:20:24.890 --> 00:20:27.600
Anri-chan, is this rain...

00:20:29.030 --> 00:20:30.550
This is awesome, Yuuma!

00:20:30.550 --> 00:20:34.320
Drinking this rain makes you feel really good!

00:20:34.320 --> 00:20:37.660
My body's all warm!

00:20:37.660 --> 00:20:41.880
Anri-chan's magic turned the rain into sake.

00:20:41.880 --> 00:20:44.670
I can't do anything now that it's happened!

00:20:44.670 --> 00:20:47.750
This is pretty good.

00:20:47.750 --> 00:20:49.250
Anri-chan!

00:20:49.250 --> 00:20:52.680
<i>Haruhi, if you don't do something this'll be really bad.</i>

00:20:52.680 --> 00:20:54.020
I know!

00:21:06.540 --> 00:21:10.570
I don't think I can go on...

00:21:39.200 --> 00:21:41.310
Thank you.

00:21:41.310 --> 00:21:42.730
Koyuki-san...

00:21:43.300 --> 00:21:50.950
If you hadn't helped with your magic, I wouldn't have been able to even take them all home either.

00:21:52.180 --> 00:21:56.090
Magic is for times like these.

00:21:58.500 --> 00:21:59.990
Do you not like magic?

00:21:59.990 --> 00:22:02.770
No, that's not it.

00:22:03.870 --> 00:22:05.820
I hope so.

00:22:07.860 --> 00:22:09.720
Kohinata-kun...

00:22:11.000 --> 00:22:12.310
She's talking in her sleep?

00:22:12.310 --> 00:22:18.180
Kohinata-kun, I want to make everyone happy with magic.

00:22:19.350 --> 00:22:21.530
Just like that boy made me happy.

00:23:55.080 --> 00:24:25.040
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:23:55.600 --> 00:23:56.560
Good afternoon!

00:23:56.560 --> 00:23:58.010
I'm Kamisaka Haruhi.

00:23:58.710 --> 00:24:01.130
This program is broadcast at night?

00:24:01.130 --> 00:24:02.520
So, once again...

00:24:02.520 --> 00:24:03.350
Good evening.

00:24:03.350 --> 00:24:04.890
I'm Kamisaka Haruhi.

00:24:05.690 --> 00:24:07.610
There are some people who record it and watch it in the morning?

00:24:07.610 --> 00:24:08.670
Then...

00:24:08.670 --> 00:24:10.200
Good morning?

00:24:10.200 --> 00:24:13.250
But it's unfair to decide on just one...

00:24:13.250 --> 00:24:14.210
I know!

00:24:14.210 --> 00:24:15.130
How about this...

00:24:15.130 --> 00:24:16.410
Good morfterning!

00:24:16.410 --> 00:24:17.880
I'm Kamisaka Haruhi.

00:24:17.880 --> 00:24:19.580
Now then, the next episode is...

00:24:19.580 --> 00:24:20.930
There's no time?

00:24:20.930 --> 00:24:22.950
The next episode is:  Oasis!

00:24:21.810 --> 00:24:25.040
<b>Oasis</b>

00:24:22.950 --> 00:24:25.050
Please watch it!
